#: about/faq.rst:66
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you are just starting out with either Rebel Engine or game development in "
"general, GDScript is the recommended language to learn and use since it is "
"native to Rebel Engine. While scripting languages tend to be less performant "
"than lower-level languages in the long run, for prototyping, developing "
"Minimum Viable Products (MVPs), and focusing on Time-To-Market (TTM), "
