"`doc_updating_the_class_reference`."

#: contributing/documentation_guidelines.rst:30
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you want to edit the **Rebel Engine API**, please note that it should "
"*not* be done in the Rebel Documentation repository. Instead, you should "
"edit the XML files in the ``docs/`` folder of Rebel Engine's repository. "
"These files are then later used to generate the in-editor documentation as "
