#: getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:20
msgid ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (named ``ScoreTimer``) - to increment the score "
"every second"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Timer <class_Timer>` (nommé ``ScoreTimer``) - pour incrémenter le "
