#: getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:37
msgid "Spawning mobs"
msgstr "Générer des monstres"

#: getting_started/first_2d_game/05.the_main_game_scene.rst:39
msgid ""
"The Main node will be spawning new mobs, and we want them to appear at a "
"random location on the edge of the screen. Add a :ref:`Path2D "
