msgid ":ref:`CSGSphere <class_CSGSphere>`"
msgstr ":ref:`CSGSphere <class_CSGSphere>`"

#: tutorials/3d/csg_tools.rst:27
msgid ":ref:`CSGTorus <class_CSGTorus>`"
msgstr ":ref:`CSGTorus <class_CSGTorus>`"

