#: tutorials/3d/portals/rooms_and_portals_example.rst:10
msgid ""
"This tutorial will introduce you to building a \"Hello World\" room system "
"with two rooms, and a portal in between."
msgstr ""
"Ce tutoriel vous initiera à la construction d'un système de salle \"Hello "
