msgid "Skeletons"
msgstr "Squelettes"

#: tutorials/animation/cutout_animation.rst:173
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In Rebel Engine there is a helper to create \"bones\" between nodes. The "
"bone-linked nodes are called skeletons."
msgstr ""
"Dans Godot, il y a une aide pour créer des \"os\" entre les nœuds. Les nœuds "
