#: tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:15
msgid ""
"The demo consists of a single scene. This scene includes two major parts: "
"the GUI and the audio."
msgstr ""
"La démo consiste en une seule scène. Cette scène comprend deux parties "
"principales : l'interface graphique et l'audio."

#: tutorials/audio/recording_with_microphone.rst:18
msgid ""
"We will focus on the audio part. In this demo, a bus named ``Record`` with "
