#: tutorials/export/exporting_for_web.rst:195
msgid "Clipboard"
msgstr "Presse-papiers"

#: tutorials/export/exporting_for_web.rst:197
msgid ""
"Clipboard synchronization between engine and the operating system requires a "
"browser supporting the `Clipboard API <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/"
"docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API>`__, additionally, due to the API asynchronous "
"nature might not be reliable when accessed from GDScript."
msgstr ""
"La synchronisation du presse-papiers entre le moteur et le système "
"d'exploitation nécessite un navigateur prenant en charge `Clipboard API "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API>`__, en "
"outre, en raison de la nature asynchrone de l'API, cela pourrait ne pas être "
"fiable lorsqu'on y accède depuis GDScript."

