#: tutorials/physics/collision_shapes_3d.rst:7
msgid "Using a convex or a concave mesh as a collision shape."
msgstr "Utilisation d'un maillage convexe ou concave comme forme de collision."

#: tutorials/physics/collision_shapes_3d.rst:8
msgid "Performance considerations regarding 3D collisions."
msgstr "Considérations de performance concernant les collisions 3D."

#: tutorials/physics/collision_shapes_3d.rst:10
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rebel Engine provides many kinds of collision shapes, with different "
"performance and accuracy tradeoffs."
msgstr ""
"Godot fournit de nombreux types de formes de collision, avec différents "
"compromis de performance et de précision."

#: tutorials/physics/collision_shapes_3d.rst:13
msgid ""
"You can define the shape of a :ref:`class_PhysicsBody` by adding one or "
"more :ref:`CollisionShapes <class_CollisionShape>` as child nodes. Note that "
"you must add a :ref:`class_Shape` *resource* to collision shape nodes in the "
