#: tutorials/scripting/gdnative/what_is_gdnative.rst:2
msgid "What is GDNative?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que GDNative ?"

#: tutorials/scripting/gdnative/what_is_gdnative.rst:7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**GDNative** lets the engine interact with native `shared libraries <https://"
