"If you are using the ``first person controller`` scene, you can simply "
"enable passthrough by checking the **Start Passthrough** option on the "
"controller node:"
msgstr ""
"Si vous utilisez la scène ``first person controller``, vous pouvez "
"simplement activer le passthrough en cochant l'option **Start Passthrough** "
"sur le nœud du contrôleur :"

#: tutorials/vr/openxr/passthrough.rst:22
